### Platform: make company 2 a partner
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/partners/2/branding
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "SmartCall",
  "domain": "app.smartcall.uz",
  "logoUrl": "https://smartcall.uz/logo.png",
  "primaryColor": "#0055FF",
  "supportEmail": "help@smartcall.uz",
  "supportPhone": "+998712000000"
}

### Partner: its own brand
GET http://localhost:8080/api/partner/branding
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Partner: sign up a client company
POST http://localhost:8080/api/partner/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Do'kon MChJ",
  "adminName": "Aziz Karimov",
  "username": "aziz",
  "email": "aziz@dokon.uz"
}

### Partner: its clients
POST http://localhost:8080/api/partner/clients/list
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "page": 0, "size": 20 }

### The brand the logged-in company's panel shows
GET http://localhost:8080/api/branding
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Login page brand (no login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public/branding?domain=app.smartcall.uz
